sourceOfTruth: AGENTS.md
requirements:
  - Keep package names and imports under @repo/*
  - Use current installed versions and official docs over memory
  - Do not introduce deprecated patterns, including deprecated TypeScript options like baseUrl
  - Use Biome for formatting and linting
  - Use latest versions, latest best practices, latest techniques
validation:
  - pnpm run format
  - pnpm run lint
  - pnpm run check
  - pnpm run build
